# Validation domain

Full checklists: `docs/ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA.md` §2 and §4.

## Required fields

Passenger Full Name, Passport Number, Nationality, Age, Gender, Flight Number, Departure Country, Destination Country, Travel Date, Email, Phone Number.

## Client rules (also re-check on server)

| Field | Rule |
|-------|------|
| All above | Required |
| Email | Valid email format |
| Passport | Project-consistent format (same regex/message client + server) |
| Age | Integer 1–120 inclusive |
| Flight number | Pattern like `AI101` (letters + digits) |
| Phone | Numeric validation |

## Server-only rules

- Duplicate passport (reject if already in DB)
- Invalid nationality (use shared allowed list/validator)
- Departure country ≠ destination country
- Travel date not in the past

## Implementation

- Define rules in `lib/validation/` (Zod recommended).
- Reuse schemas on client form and in `POST /api/passenger/validate`.
- Never persist on validation failure.
